     water to fool real ducks. This is the foreground layer, over the colour
     ic_launcher_background.

     108 x 108 dp. A launcher shows at most the middle 72 x 72 dp, cut to
     its shape, and always the middle circle of 66 dp (the safe zone), which
     holds everything here.

     Only absolute M, L, C and Z commands, which tool/make_icon_pngs.py can
     draw: it makes the Android 7 icons and the store icon from this file
     and the background colour. Run it after a change here. -->
